MOCK_FRAMEWORK_TEST_ONLY

This directory is a Schwab-LIKE mock plugin. It implements every
broker plugin contract (auth, account, order, quote, bar, stream,
sync) using deterministic in-memory fixtures so the broker compliance
harness and end-to-end tests can prove OpenAlgo's framework is ready
for a real Schwab plugin.

It is NOT real Schwab integration. It does NOT make real network
calls or perform real OAuth. The underscore prefix in the directory
name marks it as framework-test-only — never to be enabled in
production.

See ADR 0022 (mock broker plugins for framework readiness).
